For a performance review, I select campaigns and dates, compare against another period and choose an objective-based KPI pack. Daily charts, drivers, creative performance and the evidence table let me inspect the result. Saved reports retain the scope and settings for the next review.

**Meta Ads is the established internal workflow.** TikTok Ads was recently added, while the Apify-based competitor scan remains in early development. The dated screenshots in this case use the sample data described in their captions.
